analysisWe need to assess violation of Article 11. Facts: demonstration authorized, but police restricted, arrests for resisting. Article 11 protects freedom of assembly; state may restrict only for legitimate aims and proportionate. Here police used force, arrested participants for resisting? They were part of authorized demonstration; arrests for alleged breach of order. Likely violation due to excessive use of force and arbitrary detention. So yes violation.assistantfinal{"violated": true}